<title>USA: TABLE - Paxar Corp Q2 oper shr increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Paxar Corp Q2 oper shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr profit	  $0.21   profit	 $0.20</p>
<p> Net shr loss		0.08   profit	  0.20</p>
<p> Net loss		   2,244   profit	 5,613</p>
<p> Sales		    134,341		   57,554</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  29,718		   28,399</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr profit	  $0.41   profit	 $0.35</p>
<p> Net shr profit	    0.12   profit	  0.35</p>
<p> Net profit		 3,458   profit	 9,956</p>
<p> Sales		    214,796		  110,304</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  29,320		   28,310</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q2 1997 net includes a restructuring charge of $8.6 million related to the acquisition of Monarch Marking Systems Inc and an extraordinary item related to the early redemption of Monarch's 12.5 percent Senior Notes due 2003.</p>
<p>Excluding the one-time charges and the extraordinary item, Q2 1997 oper shr was a profit of $0.26.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
